{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review mandatory TB testing in Cattle",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We are concerned that some cattle that have to be culled under current regulations may not have TB. The impact on farmers can be financially crippling. We think it time to review and improve the current system.",
